#: ../../technical/articles/012-pdf-summaries-ecb-rates-and-google-sheets-exports.md:26
msgid ""
"CSV verification uses a read-only policy with a fixed host and exact "
"final viewer route, and it validates the embedded CSV rather than "
"trusting generic response wording. The PDF writer removes the document-"
"information dictionary and its module docstring says the XMP packet "
"avoids taxpayer identifiers, while the file intentionally embeds the full"
" report and CSV. XMP title and description are populated directly from "
"`presentation.title` and `presentation.notice_body`, so whether those "
"fields ever contain identity data depends on the upstream presentation "
"contract. Signing behavior belongs to the injected application certifier."
" PDF/A and PDF/UA identifiers and structural tagging demonstrate intent "
"and implementation, not external conformance certification; no validator "
"execution is in scope. `visible_layer_digest` also returns detected "
"overlays separately from the digest. The writer calls the certifier with "
"the digest and ignores the overlay list, relying on its own fresh "
"renderer not to introduce annotations or non-font page resources "
"(contract.py (`src/cadrumo/adapters/outbound/aeat/verify/contract.py`), "
"summary_container.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/outbound/calculation_summary_pdf/summary_container.py`),"
" summary_container.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/outbound/calculation_summary_pdf/summary_container.py`),"
" summary_container.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/outbound/calculation_summary_pdf/summary_container.py`),"
" summary_container.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/outbound/calculation_summary_pdf/summary_container.py`),"
" summary_reading.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/outbound/calculation_summary_pdf/summary_reading.py`))."
msgstr ""
"A CSV-ellenőrzés csak olvasható szabályzatot használ rögzített géppel és "
"pontos végső megtekintőútvonallal, és a beágyazott CSV-t ellenőrzi "
"általános válaszszöveg elfogadása helyett. A PDF-író eltávolítja a "
"dokumentuminformációs szótárat, moduljának docstringje pedig jelzi, hogy "
"az XMP-csomag kerüli az adózói azonosítókat, miközben a fájl szándékosan "
